  "title": "Make-Ahead Shrimp and Cheese Brunch Casserole",
  "description": "Pre-cooked shrimp joins Swiss cheese and eggs in a creamy blend for this easy make-ahead brunch casserole that&#39;s great for entertaining.",
  "authors": [
